13
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.153
It's yours.

14
00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:29.260
Okay, that's good!

15
00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.947
Well, you play a doctor on television

16
00:00:31.947 --> 00:00:36.191
