26
00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.206
Yeah, oh yeah, yeah.

27
00:00:58.206 --> 00:01:00.532 line:15%
We've got, we've got doctors and nurses

28
00:01:00.532 --> 00:01:02.220 line:15%
who keep us honest and, you know

29
