31
00:01:08.516 --> 00:01:10.623
but we make it happen.

32
00:01:10.623 --> 00:01:13.190
And it's been amazing to have them because, you know

33
00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:15.487
when you're doing a show that incorporates the pandemic

34
00:01:15.487 --> 00:01:17.494
and you're telling the story about that

35
00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:20.350
it's amazing to talk to these frontline workers

36
00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:24.130
